--TEST--
a `#[Json\Derive]` field must be a constructor parameter of the same name and the same type, because a decode is an ordinary `new` — ADR 0071 § 2
--FILE--
<?nvs
#[Core\Json\Derive]
class User {
    public string $name;
    public int $age;

    public function constructor(string $age) {
        $this->name = "";
        $this->age = 0;
    }
}
echo "unreachable\n";
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0460]: `$name` is a `#[Json\Derive]` field with no constructor parameter
  --> case.nvs:4:19
%A
error[E0461]: `$age` is declared `int` but its constructor parameter is `string`
  --> case.nvs:5:16
%A
error: aborting due to 2 errors
